B.bwD=new A.ap(B.bzA,["That GSTIN is not the right shape. Fifteen characters: two digits for the state, then the ten of the PAN, then 1Z and a check character.","That GSTIN is not the right shape. Fifteen characters, starting with the two-digit state code.","That PAN is not the right shape - five letters, four digits, one letter.","That TAN is not the right shape - four letters, five digits, one letter.","That GSTIN is not the right shape.",u.iF,u.iF,"A bank's IFSC letters are exactly four - SBIN, HDFC, ICIC.","That is not a valid IFSC. Eleven characters: four letters for the bank, a zero, then six for the branch.","A MICR code is exactly nine digits.",u.x,"A UPI id reads name@bank.",u.hw,u.hw,"That is not a phone number.","That is not a phone number.","That is not a phone number.","That is not a phone number.","That is not a phone number.",u.fj,"That is not an email address.","That is not an email address.","A name needs at least one letter in it, and 2 to 120 characters. A number on its own is not a name.",u.A,"That note is too long - keep it under 1000 characters, about 150 words.","That reason is too long - keep it under 1000 characters.","CGST and SGST are half the total each. They are worked out here rather than typed.","A cess charged per unit needs the unit - so much per what?","Advance, on delivery and after receipt cannot come to more than the whole bill.","The factor has to be more than zero.","A unit cannot convert to itself.","Decimal places have to be between 0 and 6.","A paper cannot expire before it was issued.","The period cannot end before it begins.","The certificate cannot expire before it starts.","That ceiling is below what has already been deducted under this certificate. Raise it, or issue a new certificate.","The ceiling has to be more than zero - that is what the certificate grants.","A blacklisted party needs the reason recorded - it is what Purchase prints when the block fires.","A rating is out of five.","A score is out of five.","A weight has to be more than zero, or the score counts for nothing.","The warning has to be between 0 and 365 days before.","Keep for has to be a number of years, or empty for no rule.","The number of digits has to be between 1 and 12.","The break is longer than the shift itself. A shift has to leave some hours to work.","Grace has to be between 0 and 240 minutes.","Whether a shift runs past midnight is decided by its start and end times, not set separately."],t.w)
